WEBVTT

00:03:58.943 --> 00:04:01.904
and proceed to show me
all the newspaper clippings he had saved

00:04:01.946 --> 00:04:03.531
with my name and face on them.

00:04:04.532 --> 00:04:07.743
He said the words he was wrong.

00:04:08.327 --> 00:04:11.414
Words I had never heard
a man say before to me.

00:04:12.290 --> 00:04:15.001
He said that I had done
what no one else could have done,

00:04:15.001 --> 00:04:17.253
and I had made the family name proud.

00:04:17.670 --> 00:04:20.589
Me, Lilly, the baby born a girl.

00:04:21.215 --> 00:04:22.425
That's right.

00:04:22.425 --> 00:04:26.304
Now in that moment
I truly felt like Superwoman.

00:04:26.345 --> 00:04:27.513
I did.

00:04:27.555 --> 00:04:29.307
You know, through my YouTube videos,

00:04:29.307 --> 00:04:33.894
I've amassed almost 15 million subscribers
and three billion views.